        "body": "Serve Robotics Inc. /DE/ is a for-profit public company headquartered in San Carlos, California, trading under the ticker SERV. Its SEC CIK number is 0001832483. The company describes itself as a provider of sustainable, self-driving delivery, asking \"Why move a 2-pound burrito in a 2-ton car?\" and positioning its service as a low-emissions solution to the last-mile problem.\n\nThe company's website says it is setting the standard for safety on and beyond the sidewalk, and that it protects customer data, employees, and the public. It describes its delivery robot, Saymo, as a pop culture icon that appears as John Mulaney's sidekick on the show \"Everybody's Live.\" No additional products are listed.\n\nCalifornia is the jurisdiction for 281 legal exposure items associated with the company. No court cases are listed.",
